   "caption": "Seven years together. From the junior ranks to Formula 1. Oscar Piastri and his management team, led by Mark and Ann Webber, have mutually agreed to part ways. Their partnership began in 2019 and helped secure his move from Alpine to McLaren. Webber had already reduced his trackside involvement this season. 🗣️ “Their guidance has been invaluable, particularly in navigating the beginning of my F1 career.” Oscar’s farewell to the team that helped him reach the grid.",
