   "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfgMNBpAOqU/",
   "mediaType": "CAROUSEL_ALBUM",
   "caption": "We are Constructor’s Champions!! 🏆 Not the kind of result I would have liked to win the constructor’s with, the win was at our reach today, shame for the end result. I’m anyway so grateful for the work put in by the whole team. From Brackley to Brixworth, this win is for all of you guys that qorked hard and gave me a car to achieve one of my dreams. I’m forever grateful and we will keep pushing to bring more wins, starting from the next one 💪🏻 Thanks to all the Brazilian fans too, obrigado for your support this weekend that has been incredible! See you soon 🇧🇷❤️",
